 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "青木さんから返事が来たね。見出しはまだ確認中だけど、お父さんの話を足すと、昔を懐かしむだけの展示ではなくなるね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D001-S01",
    "C71-D001-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 8.944,
   "duration_sec": 8.944
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "うん。でも文字が多い。写真の前で話に花が咲く余地も残そう。青木さんは昔の写真部の仲間との思い出話も楽しみにしているよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D002-S01",
    "C71-D002-S02",
    "C71-D002-S03",
    "C71-D002-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 9.294,
   "end_sec": 20.497,
   "duration_sec": 11.203
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "案内の「オービー」は「卒業生」に直すね。それから、この「弛みない努力の賜物」は誰の言葉？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D003-S01",
    "C71-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 20.847,
   "end_sec": 28.218,
   "duration_sec": 7.371
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "僕が書いた。作品に心血を注いだ経験をほめたかったけど、ずっと努力し続けたかは聞いていない。本人の言葉に戻そう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D004-S01",
    "C71-D004-S02",
    "C71-D004-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.568,
   "end_sec": 37.445,
   "duration_sec": 8.877
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "「先覚者」「博学多才」も大げさかな。写真の保存に長けているとは聞いたけど、幅広い学識があるかは、この写真だけでは分からないよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D005-S01",
    "C71-D005-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 37.795,
   "end_sec": 47.888,
   "duration_sec": 10.093
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "そうだね。去年の保存セミナーで知り合った人に聞いて、方法だけ紹介しよう。新しい試みがものになるまでの過程なら、ほかの人の励みにもなる。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D006-S01",
    "C71-D006-S02",
    "C71-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 48.238,
   "end_sec": 59.516,
   "duration_sec": 11.278
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D009",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "でも成功ばかり強調したら、また本人の話から離れるよ。「自慢の作品」より「残したい一枚」はどう？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D009-S01",
    "C71-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 59.866,
   "end_sec": 69.395,
   "duration_sec": 9.529
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D010",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "いいね。見る人の心を鷲掴みにする見出しを考えて、内容を変えてしまった。反語の「撮るものか」も、目立たせるためだけには使わない。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D010-S01",
    "C71-D010-S02",
    "C71-D010-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 69.745,
   "end_sec": 80.215,
   "duration_sec": 10.47
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D011",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "当時の気持ちが伝わる文章を選ぼう。ところで、これは川に昔の橋の名残りがある写真？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D011-S01",
    "C71-D011-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 80.565,
   "end_sec": 88.327,
   "duration_sec": 7.762
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D016",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "うん。「わあ、まだある」と美咲さんがびっくりして、二人で大笑いしたんだって。流行の撮り方をまねした写真より印象的だと言っていたよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D016-S01",
    "C71-D016-S02",
    "C71-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 88.677,
   "end_sec": 98.44,
   "duration_sec": 9.763
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D017",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "たくさん語ってくれたんだね。二人がわくわくと町を歩く姿が浮かぶ。私もどの写真が選ばれるか楽しみ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D017-S01",
    "C71-D017-S02",
    "C71-D017-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 98.79,
   "end_sec": 107.413,
   "duration_sec": 8.623
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D018",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "今は六枚が候補で、二枚の人物の許可はまだだよ。興奮して全部載せてしまわないように、案内の枚数欄は空けておこう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D018-S01",
    "C71-D018-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 107.763,
   "end_sec": 116.332,
   "duration_sec": 8.569
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D021",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "分かった。タイトルも青木さんの確認を待つ。再会の時に抱き合うほど喜ぶかどうかも、私たちには決められないね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D021-S01",
    "C71-D021-S02",
    "C71-D021-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 116.682,
   "end_sec": 125.662,
   "duration_sec": 8.98
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C71-D022",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "そうだね。感激を期待しすぎず、本人のペースで語れる場にしよう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C71-D022-S01",
    "C71-D022-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 126.012,
   "end_sec": 130.934,
   "duration_sec": 4.922
  }
 ],
